{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"89b8225a7126f9bc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"model/model_minimind.py ----项目之魂",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":540,
			"y":-240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"a85a9cf843a6492e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"整个项目最重要的文件, 所有模型结构都包含在此",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":890,
			"y":-300,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"60b5e6d25ad33dd1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"|类名|作用|对应概念|\n|---|---|---|\n|`MiniMindConfig`|模型配置|定义所有超参数（隐藏层大小、层数、头数等）|\n|`RMSNorm`|归一化层|L02 中讲的 Layer Normalization（简化版）|\n|`Attention`|注意力机制|L02 中讲的 Self-Attention + GQA + RoPE|\n|`FeedForward`|前馈网络|L02 中讲的 SwiGLU FFN|\n|`MoEGate` / `MOEFeedForward`|专家混合|MoE 版本的 FFN（高级话题）|\n|`MiniMindBlock`|Transformer 块|一层完整的 Transformer（Pre-Norm + Attention + FFN + 残差）|\n|`MiniMindModel`|模型主体|Embedding + N × Block + 最终 RMSNorm|\n|`MiniMindForCausalLM`|因果语言模型|MiniMindModel + lm_head + 损失计算 + 生成|",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":900,
			"y":-200,
			"width":700,
			"height":400,
			"color":"1"
		},
